Package: kf6-texteditor
Version: @DEB_KTEXTEDITOR_V@
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: @DEB_MAINTAINER@
Section: Libraries
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://kde.org/
Depends: qt6-base, qt6-declarative, kf6-archive, kf6-completion, kf6-config, kf6-guiaddons, kf6-i18n, kf6-kio, kf6-parts, kf6-sonnet, kf6-syntax-highlighting, kf6-textwidgets
Description: KF6 TextEditor for the Xios desktop
